	'k0a32ed7f' => 'The travel kit',
	'k0b5f6dc4' => 'Every journey starts with a forty-five-minute call and the questions you already have. We listen to how you like to spend your mornings, how far you prefer to walk, and what pace feels peaceful before drawing a single line on the map.',
