	'k0c6588c0' => 'The Azores',
	'k0d7bb752' => 'Map table · Valmere studio',
	'k0de19510' => 'For milestone anniversaries or special celebrations, one partner often wishes to organize the entire journey as a surprise. With our surprise planning service, available for an additional €120, we coordinate directly with the organizing partner while strictly safeguarding all confidential details. We arrange confidential video consultations, dispatch correspondence to personal email addresses only, and produce sealed reveal envelopes for flight details and destinations. Your partner learns where you are going only when you hand over the destination envelope at the airport, while you travel with complete confidence that every detail has been planned.',
