	'k0ed0e507' => 'Every region here has been walked, ridden or sailed by someone in the studio before it reaches a route.',
	'k0fbf6fc4' => 'Private veranda dining beside the sea',
	'k1032ac7b' => 'To receive the dispatch, enter your email address in our subscription form or write directly to hello@futari-journeys.example with the subject Subscribe to The Route Letter. If you use our web form, your email app opens with the message ready, and you are not on the list until you send it. We keep our subscriber list completely private, never share contact details with outside parties, and send no advertising or frequent marketing updates between the seasonal dispatches. You may remove your address from our mailing list at any time with a simple reply.',
