	'k1b6e2277' => 'Your planning fee covers the undivided attention of a dedicated planner from your first call to your return flight. It includes the research and design of a bespoke itinerary, two full rounds of route changes, direct coordination with independent accommodations and transport operators, Jonas Weber managing booking logistics, and Priya Nair checking your entry paperwork. It also includes Ren Ishida\'s hand-drawn maps, your printed day sheets sent fourteen days before departure, and round-the-clock emergency assistance from Camille Laurent on our travel-day line. We take no commission from hotels.',
