	'k2c540ddf' => 'Shapes archipelago routes, coastal walks and seaside hideaways across the Azores and Zanzibar.',
	'k2cfa5ad6' => 'At your pace',
	'k2d70f816' => 'Notes from the autumn and the year ahead',
	'k2dcede36' => 'Travel expenses vary based on your chosen season, destinations, and style of travel. Most honeymoons we plan range between €6,000 and €14,000 for two, including flights, characterful stays, and private transfers. For instance, an eight-night rail journey across Slovenia in September came to €5,200 for two, while a five-night autumn anniversary stay at a restored masseria in Puglia cost €3,600 for two. We provide honest estimates during your initial call, and because we never take supplier commissions, we pass on any seasonal rates or discounts directly to you.',
	'k2fd9ba4f' => 'While you are travelling, our dedicated travel-day line is staffed twenty-four hours a day by Camille Laurent and our support team. If a flight is delayed or cancelled, weather interrupts a planned ferry crossing, or you simply wish to modify a dinner reservation on the road, you can call or message us immediately. We manage schedule adjustments directly with transport operators and local properties so you do not spend your holiday negotiating logistics. If you have an inquiry not covered in these questions, you are welcome to book a planning call with our studio.',
	'k305e9598' => 'Regional trains between alpine rivers, limestone peaks and Adriatic promenades. Good for lakeside trails and architectural walks.',
	'k30b2154d' => 'Mei and Tomasz celebrated their tenth anniversary with an eight-night rail journey across Slovenia in September, planned by Lina Haddad for €5,200 for two. The couple initially asked whether travelling exclusively by train would restrict their access to quieter mountain hamlets. Lina designed a route using local regional lines and short scheduled transfers, replacing a rental car entirely. The outline opened with three nights beside Lake Bohinj for quiet alpine walking, followed by two nights in Ljubljana exploring riverside markets, and concluded with three nights near the coastal town of Piran on the Adriatic.',
	'k30d01d0b' => 'The studio',
	'k31be0a6a' => 'Hand-drawn by Ren Ishida, without lettering clutter',
	'k3283ca3f' => 'Aiko Brandt founds Futari Journeys',
	'k32b07114' => 'Honeymoons',
	'k32f6126f' => 'Every journey begins with a free forty-five-minute video call to discuss your preferences, dates, and budget. Within seven days of that conversation, we present your tailored first route alongside a fixed planning fee. Next, we include two full rounds of changes, refining stops, travel pacing, and hotel selections until the plan fits you both perfectly. In step four, once you approve the route, we confirm reservations with suppliers, and you pay deposits directly to each property and carrier. Finally, fourteen days before departure, you receive your printed travel kit, backed by our twenty-four-hour travel-day line throughout your trip.',
	'k3389264c' => 'We believe in complete clarity before you begin planning. Our planning fees are fixed upfront, while travel expenses are paid directly to hotels, railways, and local operators.',
	'k339d7007' => 'Fees are paid in two halves: 50% after the first route, 50% when bookings are confirmed. Travel is paid directly to hotels, airlines and guides. Cancelling the planning fee is free until the first route is sent.',
