	'k4e97aeea' => 'When',
	'k4f43310a' => 'For a honeymoon, we recommend starting four to nine months before your departure date. That window allows us to secure quiet guesthouses, coordinate scenic rail connections, and reserve specific room categories without rushing your decisions. If you only know the calendar month you wish to travel, that is entirely sufficient for our initial discussion; we often suggest destinations based on seasonal conditions, such as the Azores in May or Zanzibar in February. For an anniversary weekend in a single destination, six weeks is usually enough time to assemble a thoughtful plan.',
	'k4f4fd6cb' => 'If you are in Valmere or prefer to meet in person, we welcome visits to our planning studio on the second floor of 8 Linden Row. Studio visits are arranged by advance appointment Tuesday to Saturday from 10:00 to 18:00. You can reach our front desk by telephone at +00 0000 0000 or by email at hello@futari-journeys.example. We are always glad to spread out our blank maps and region photographs across our timber table to explore journey ideas together over tea.',
	'k4fb581ac' => '← Back to the journal',
	'k504fcd89' => 'hello@futari-journeys.example',
	'k505ca564' => 'Information we collect and how we use it',
	'k511449ea' => 'Q · 03',
	'k518c0c7b' => 'For couples seeking unhurried days anchored in one peaceful place, we recommend slow rural escapes. In Puglia, best experienced in October and May, ancient olive groves, dry-stone walls, and whitewashed masserias offer four to seven nights of gentle respite. This countryside is good for travellers who appreciate farm-to-table meals under the trees, quiet country lanes, and coastal viewpoints without a rigid timetable. Staying at small, family-owned rural estates allows couples to unpack once, explore nearby villages at leisure, and return each evening to homemade bread, local wine, and complete quiet.',
