	'k6469d36c' => 'Here are the questions couples ask most often when planning a journey together. If your question is not answered here, we are glad to discuss it during a free planning call.',
	'k6488bf1b' => 'Ten nights on the coral coast in Zanzibar',
	'k64ae42b1' => 'For their honeymoon in February, Grace and Kofi sought ocean horizons and slow coastal living. Planned by Mateus Okafor, this ten-night trip totalled €11,400 for two. On their first planning call, they expressed concern about resort crowds; Mateus structured their stay around family-run lodges on quieter stretches of sand. The route paired three nights in Stone Town exploring labyrinthine alleys and spice history with seven nights on the southeast coral coast watching wooden dhows at low tide.',
	'k66cc173f' => 'Since 2014',
