	'k68cc42e9' => 'Travel insurance',
	'k69175728' => 'Within 7 days',
	'k69e9efcb' => 'Elena and Marco celebrated their twenty-fifth anniversary with a five-night autumn stay in Puglia in October, planned by Aiko Brandt for €3,600 for two. The trip was arranged as a complete surprise planned by Marco, using our surprise planning service. During early video calls, Marco explained that Elena loved countryside tranquility, long dinners, and uncrowded lanes. Aiko arranged five nights at a secluded restored masseria set among ancient olive groves near Valle d\'Itria.',
