	'k6c6ea3d6' => 'Two weeks before your departure, we post your custom travel kit to your home. Inside, you will find a hand-drawn route map created by Ren Ishida showing your entire journey without confusing markings, along with detailed day sheets outlining daily recommendations, travel times, and quiet dining ideas. The kit also includes a structured bookings folder with printed confirmations and contact details for every stay and transport segment. Most importantly, you gain access to our twenty-four-hour travel-day line managed by Camille Laurent, ensuring immediate personal support whenever questions arise on the road.',
