	'k7ba73e32' => 'Noor and Daniel wanted an active honeymoon with dramatic landscapes and quiet evenings. Planned by Mateus Okafor for May, this twelve-night journey across three islands came to a budget from €9,800 for two. On their initial call, they asked whether visiting four islands would feel too hurried; Mateus adjusted the route twice, dropping one flight to preserve three unhurried nights on each island. The route began on São Miguel exploring volcanic crater lakes, continued to São Jorge for coastal walks along cliffside fajãs, and finished on Faial overlooking the Atlantic harbour.',
