	'k814c5327' => 'Our rail journeys connect high mountain valleys to coastal harbours without the stress of driving or airports. In Slovenia, best travelled in September and October, regional trains thread between emerald alpine rivers, limestone peaks, and Adriatic seaside promenades across seven to ten nights. This region is especially good for couples who value scenic journeys, lakeside trails around Lake Bohinj, and architectural walks through historic Ljubljana. Travelling by train allows uninterrupted time together by the window, watching the landscape shift gradually from forested mountain passes down to quiet stone fishing ports.',
	'k82331503' => 'December',
