	'k8ef1cb25' => 'Forty-five minutes by private video',
	'k8f63d9bd' => 'Payment of our planning fee is divided into two equal parts: fifty percent is due after we send your first tailored route, and the remaining fifty percent is due once all bookings are confirmed. If you choose to cancel before that first route is sent, there is no charge. Direct travel costs, such as lodging and transport, are paid straight to suppliers under their individual deposit terms. If friends or family members wish to contribute toward your journey, we can arrange gift contributions toward specific activities, private dinners, or rail legs.',
	'k8f6e38e3' => 'Chapter 03',
	'k8f7f4c1c' => 'About',
	'k90998f70' => 'What you receive',
	'k919febe9' => 'The five steps',
	'k9269b061' => 'Book a planning call',
	'k937e6a4c' => 'Days 9–12',
	'k9389b22a' => 'The link may be old, or the page may have moved. The questions couples ask are a good place to start, or you can book a planning call.',
	'k93ea2ea8' => '5–7 nights, up to 2 stops',
	'k93ee50ca' => 'Futari Journeys was founded on a simple conviction: travel for two should be designed with patience, personal care, and thoughtful questions. We take on about forty trips each year so that every couple receives our full attention.',
	'k9402a9c5' => 'She verifies passport validity dates, clarifies visa procedures, and checks entry paperwork twice before departure.',
	'k94219c92' => 'We design one trip at a time, staying with each couple from the first video call until you return home. Here is how our planning process unfolds from the first conversation to the journey itself.',
	'k951beba4' => 'Studio visits',
	'k9594d687' => 'Meet the seven of us →',
	'k98435214' => 'Planning calls',
	'k9940d653' => 'Aiko Brandt founded Futari Journeys in 2014 after planning a bespoke honeymoon for her sister, discovering how rarely travel planners listen before proposing itineraries. In 2017, we opened our studio on the second floor of 8 Linden Row in Valmere. In 2020, we established our dedicated twenty-four-hour travel-day line to assist couples while on the road. By 2024, our studio had planned its three-hundredth bespoke journey. Today, we are a close team of seven people, intentionally limiting our work to about forty journeys a year so that every couple works with a single planner throughout.',
	'k9951dfb4' => 'Rooms, trains and guides secured directly, with no hotel commission.',
	'k9a95a3c5' => 'Days 8–10',
	'k9b5ff90a' => 'Afterwards',
	'k9b738f78' => 'Sample Trips',
	'k9be7feef' => 'Both travellers need passports with at least six months of validity remaining beyond your return date, along with blank pages for stamps. Priya Nair reviews your route requirements and lists any necessary tourist visas or entry permits; you submit the official applications, and Priya checks the paperwork twice to avoid oversights. If you marry right before travelling, you must book transport and travel under the exact name shown in your passport on departure day. We also recommend comprehensive travel insurance, which we do not sell. Fourteen days before departure, we deliver your complete travel kit.',
	'k9c2013d6' => 'Our working day follows a calm, regular rhythm at 8 Linden Row. At 08:30, the travel-day line hands over smoothly from the night shift to daytime support. At 09:00, our planners begin their first video consultations with couples across Europe. At 11:00, the team gathers around our long timber table for collaborative route reviews, spreading out printed photographs and hand-drawn maps. Lunch is shared at 13:00. At 14:00, Jonas Weber coordinates bookings and supplier communications. At 16:00, Priya Nair conducts rigorous document checks. The studio closes at 18:00, before our final video call concludes at 19:00.',
	'k9c565fc5' => 'Q · 01',
	'k9d1296cd' => 'Days 4–7',
	'k9d18b923' => 'Six weeks ahead is enough',
	'k9e529b12' => 'Book a planning call →',
	'k9eb33f5b' => 'Everything couples ask',
	'k9f8a681f' => 'Marco planned this one in secret with us: a farm table, olive trees and a very long lunch.',
	'k9fb878a4' => 'Passports',
	'k9fcf881e' => 'Days 6–8',
	'k9fda1652' => 'The planning fee is separate from what you spend on the trip.',
	'ka053b537' => '24 hours a day while you travel',
	'ka0d4a91b' => 'Camille Laurent',
	'ka10a9bcd' => 'Legal',
	'ka30633ac' => 'We plan only where we have travelled ourselves, choosing places with quiet character, thoughtful hosts, and unhurried roads. Our routes focus on three distinct landscapes suited to honeymoons and milestone anniversaries.',
	'ka3785a1b' => 'The studio is small on purpose, so the person who answers your first call is still the person you write to on the way home.',
	'ka4389de2' => 'Notes from the summer and the months open after the new year',
	'ka52fe004' => 'How far ahead should we start planning our trip?',
	'ka55e17c1' => 'Since 2014,<br>one couple at a time,<br>about forty trips a year.',
	'ka5787f48' => 'Furnas hot springs',
	'ka6bbc390' => 'Slow countryside',
	'ka73c7f30' => 'Our planning fees are fixed per couple: the initial forty-five-minute video call is free; an anniversary weekend of two to four nights in one place is €290; a short escape of five to seven nights with up to two stops is €450; a honeymoon of eight to sixteen nights with up to three stops is €780; and a long journey of seventeen to thirty nights across two or more countries is €1,150. For surprise journeys where one partner plans and we keep the secret, our surprise planning add-on is €120.',
	'ka767db9e' => 'Anniversary weekend',
	'ka8c4f3f4' => 'Slovenia · Sep–Oct',
	'ka97cb29c' => 'Visas and entry permits',
	'kaabda4ec' => 'How It Works',
	'kad217351' => 'Start four to nine months ahead for a honeymoon; six weeks is enough for an anniversary weekend.',
	'kad701190' => 'How the call works',
	'kae03477a' => 'Bookings confirmed',
	'kaef643a5' => 'Part 02',
	'kaf01b6d6' => 'Historic architecture and evening harbor walks',
	'kb0d37474' => 'This page has wandered off.',
	'kb0eff9a7' => 'Travel-day line: 24 hours a day while you travel',
	'kb2083102' => 'What does a honeymoon usually cost for two?',
	'kb20bcbf2' => 'From the first call until you are back home.',
	'kb24ce0cd' => 'Free',
	'kb2d4e8a2' => '45 minutes by video',
	'kb32a72d8' => 'The studio opens at 8 Linden Row, Valmere',
	'kb37043df' => 'Day 5',
	'kb3966836' => 'What travel costs',
	'kb3af9f38' => 'One trip at a time.',
	'kb3d9585f' => 'Our planning calls last forty-five minutes, take place over private video, and are completely free of charge. They are scheduled Monday to Saturday between 09:00 and 19:00 CET. You do not need a completed itinerary or fixed dates before we talk; bring your dates if you already have them, or simply bring your questions if you are unsure where to begin. During our call, we discuss your travel pacing, preferences, and budget expectations. Within seven days of our conversation, we deliver an initial custom route and a fixed planning fee.',
	'kb5b37004' => 'Regions: the Azores and Zanzibar',
	'kb70024d2' => 'Question 04 — On the trip',
	'kb7e5446a' => 'Four letters a year',
	'kb8d74d17' => 'Where we plan',
	'kb91f7432' => 'A long week, one or two bases',
	'kb9631843' => 'How it works →',
	'kba2a9c6c' => 'Length',
	'kbac68f66' => 'We operate with total independence from hotel chains and referral networks. We do not accept commissions, marketing rebates, or booking kickbacks from any lodging provider, rail operator, or local guide. By refusing commercial commissions, our planners remain free to recommend small guesthouses, historic farms, and quiet coastal lodgings chosen solely for their charm, hospitality, and quality. Whenever an accommodation partner offers a seasonal rate reduction or preferred price, that financial advantage is passed on entirely to you, keeping your interests at the center of every booking.',
	'kbb06700b' => 'Route map, day sheets and bookings folder, plus the travel-day line on the road.',
	'kbb1640f1' => 'Aiko Brandt',
	'kbbaff128' => 'Contact',
	'kbc3b32cb' => 'For a honeymoon, four to nine months allows time to secure boutique rooms and peaceful transfers without rushing. For an anniversary weekend, six weeks is plenty of time to assemble a thoughtful escape.',
	'kbcfd0021' => 'When you request a planning call, we collect your names, email address, telephone number, and initial thoughts regarding travel dates and budget. During route design, Priya Nair collects passport details to verify validity and review visa regulations, while Jonas Weber uses your details to secure lodging reservations and transport bookings. We never sell, rent, or distribute personal information to third parties or commercial marketing networks. Your information is accessed exclusively by our seven team members at 8 Linden Row to arrange your journey and provide twenty-four-hour travel-day support.',
	'kbd24acad' => 'Question 03 — Documents',
	'kbdc781a6' => 'Trip 02 — Slovenia',
	'kbe62ee40' => 'By appointment',
	'kbf0da5a8' => 'Planners',
	'kbf2f929f' => 'Our planning fee is billed in two equal installments: fifty percent once your initial custom route is delivered, and fifty percent after your itinerary is finalized and supplier bookings are secured. If you decide not to proceed before that first route is sent, cancellation is completely free. Accommodation, train tickets, ferries, and flights are paid directly to the individual providers under their respective booking terms. Jonas Weber verifies all payment schedules so you always know when each supplier payment is due, keeping your finances orderly and transparent.',
	'kc0c2ebd6' => 'Region 01',
	'kc214e10a' => 'How a trip is built',
	'kc2702c7b' => 'Region 03',
	'kc2ba7e78' => 'Service',
	'kc3eb91e6' => 'Our planning fee covers the time we spend designing your route and coordinating suppliers, kept entirely separate from your travel spending. Planning calls are free. Our fees are fixed: €290 for an anniversary weekend of two to four nights, €450 for a short escape of five to seven nights, €780 for a honeymoon of eight to sixteen nights, and €1,150 for a long journey of seventeen to thirty nights across two or more countries. Adding surprise planning is €120. Most honeymoons we plan cost between €6,000 and €14,000 for two, flights included. We never accept hotel commissions, ensuring every recommendation remains independent.',
	'kc424af54' => 'Monday–Saturday 09:00–19:00 CET',
	'kc476c5f4' => 'See the trips we have planned →',
	'kc47c3aa1' => 'Sample trips',
	'kc49be2db' => 'Read the questions',
