	'kc65832c9' => 'Coastal views',
	'kc700dedf' => 'Data retention and your rights',
	'kc7c18bcd' => 'About forty trips a year, each with one planner.',
	'kc888165d' => 'Monday–Saturday, 09:00–19:00 CET',
	'kc91c6145' => 'See every fee →',
	'kca2c4378' => 'Grace and Kofi chose a low-tide coast, one wooden boat day and nothing else scheduled before ten.',
	'kca4b2e4e' => '8 nights by rail · 10th anniversary · €5,200 for two',
	'kcc5d9056' => 'September',
	'kcc81951b' => 'A name change after the wedding',
	'kcd6ba91f' => 'We list every entry permit and visa for your route so you can apply directly. Priya checks your documents twice before departure.',
	'kcd8d4a30' => 'Most honeymoons we plan range from €6,000 to €14,000 for two, flights included. We discuss your exact parameters openly on the first call so there are never surprises.',
	'kce7e2f81' => 'How far ahead should we start?',
	'kce9e1fc7' => 'Visit the studio',
	'kced9bd74' => 'Free of charge',
	'kcedc7f47' => 'The Route Letter is our seasonal dispatch sent four times a year. It shares quiet reflections on where couples travelled and announces calendar openings for upcoming seasons.',
	'kcfd5ab32' => 'Fee per couple',
	'kd14c935d' => 'Four letters a year, in March, June, September and December: where couples went that season and which months open next. Nothing else.',
	'kd1bdb883' => 'The trip',
	'kd2561fce' => '8 nights by rail · 10th anniversary · September · €5,200 for two · Lina Haddad',
	'kd27b066d' => 'Behind every route is a small studio of seven people working together in Valmere. One planner is dedicated to your journey from your first call until your return home.',
	'kd2fd5c89' => 'Four trips, as planned',
	'kd347f796' => 'Designs scenic overland routes, alpine stays and lake-to-sea rail journeys across Slovenia.',
	'kd424758f' => '10 nights · honeymoon · €11,400 for two',
	'kd5072c61' => 'Plans honeymoons and anniversary journeys with personal care from the first call to the flight home.',
	'kd58c77b9' => 'Tuesday–Saturday 10:00–18:00',
	'kd61ac03a' => 'What is included',
	'kd7544e50' => 'Wine and fresh bread at sunset',
	'kd7661d39' => 'We collect only the personal information required to plan your route and secure your travel reservations. This statement explains how your details are held and protected by our studio.',
	'kd7e8d4f6' => 'Both travellers need passports valid for at least six months beyond the return date, with enough blank pages for stamps.',
	'kd8045700' => 'We publish four letters each year, dispatched in March, June, September, and December. Each issue contains only two things: honest field notes about where couples travelled during that past season, and a clear announcement of which calendar months have opened for upcoming route planning. You will read about specific experiences, such as springtime ferry crossings in the Azores or autumn grape harvests in Puglia, without promotional hyperbole. We share practical observations about route timings, regional train connections, and quiet rural lodgings that our travellers enjoyed.',
	'kd8a58d88' => 'When you pay',
	'kd8f89674' => 'Coral coastlines, warm shallows and historic stone streets, with quiet guesthouses away from resort developments.',
	'kd9501bfe' => 'Bring your dates and your questions',
	'kda760c9f' => 'Fourteen days before departure, you receive your travel kit: a hand-drawn route map, day sheets and a bookings folder, backed by our travel-day line, which answers 24 hours a day while you are away.',
	'kdafd8a7e' => 'We plan island routes for couples seeking expansive ocean horizons and uncrowded shorelines. In the Azores, best visited in May and June, volcanic crater lakes, hydrangeas, and quiet harbours provide a dramatic setting across ten to fourteen nights. This archipelago is particularly good for couples who enjoy coastal hiking, hot springs, and island-hopping by ferry. In Zanzibar, best visited in February and September, coral coastlines, warm Indian Ocean shallows, and historic stone streets offer ten to twelve nights of calm seclusion. We pair quiet guesthouses on the southeast sands with days watching wooden dhows at low tide, away from commercial resort developments.',
	'kdba1d0c3' => 'Studio: Tuesday–Saturday 10:00–18:00, by appointment',
	'kde13df9e' => '12 nights · honeymoon · from €9,800 for two',
	'kdf06f699' => 'Day 4',
	'kdf20cb4b' => 'Notes from the winter journeys and the spring months still open',
	'kdf9accaa' => 'How is the planning fee worked out?',
	'kdfeed6d1' => 'Answered 24 hours a day by Camille Laurent',
	'ke0fcc47d' => 'What the fee covers',
	'ke1109943' => 'We plan about forty trips a year so that a dedicated planner stays with you from the first conversation to the flight home. You have direct access to the person who designed your route whenever a question arises.',
	'ke1266e8b' => 'While you are away',
	'ke1422c65' => 'Medical and cancellation cover matters. We recommend independent policies for your route, though we do not sell insurance ourselves.',
	'ke16dd6e1' => 'Prices',
