	'kef9512f3' => 'A first route and a fixed planning fee within seven days',
	'kf01321a6' => 'Nothing is chosen from a brochure. Every stop is added, moved or dropped because of something the two of you said.',
	'kf0273b1d' => 'He draws custom route maps without cluttering labels for your travel kit, so the geography of your journey is immediately legible.',
