	'kf42742dc' => 'Jonas Weber',
	'kf7f5f242' => 'Olive groves, dry-stone walls and whitewashed masserias. Good for farm-to-table meals and quiet country lanes.',
	'kf85d82b5' => '10 nights · honeymoon · February · €11,400 for two · Mateus Okafor',
	'kf9fd7ed0' => 'We can recommend routes shaped around regional seasons, microclimates, and quiet intervals when coastal paths or mountain trains are at their most unhurried.',
	'kfa3e5eda' => 'March',
	'kfa4d02bc' => 'Twelve nights, three islands',
	'kfa918d1d' => 'Planning fees',
	'kfb6a3056' => 'Every journey we plan is built around the specific questions and rhythms of two people travelling together. Below are four recent journeys illustrating how routes take shape across different seasons and landscapes.',
	'kfc35f996' => 'The planning call',
	'kfca6113e' => 'By train, lake to sea',
	'kfd6be53d' => 'Camille Laurent manages the travel-day line, providing round-the-clock support while you travel. If a flight schedule changes or a ferry connection is rescheduled, Camille steps in immediately to adjust arrangements smoothly. Because our entire team works together in our Valmere studio, our seven colleagues consult on every route. We intentionally plan only about forty journeys each year, ensuring that your assigned planner has ample time to attend to every detail, discuss your questions, and remain available from your opening call until you arrive back home.',
	'kfd9084b3' => 'Coastal olive terraces',
	'kfddc469f' => 'How do deposits, cancellations, and gifts work after booking?',
	'kfe2b4403' => 'Travel on the name that is in your passport. If it has not legally changed yet, your tickets must still match that document.',
